{
  "has_chain": false,
  "tags": [
    "theology",
    "history",
    "quran_commentary"
  ],
  "content_type": "quranic_commentary",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَوَهَبْنَا لَهُ سُلَيْمَانَ نِعْمَ الْعَبْدُ إِنَّهُ أَوَّابٌ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And We gave Solomon (as a gift) the excellent servant, indeed he was one given to return (to God)."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "إِذْ عُرِضَ عَلَيْهِ بِالْعَشِيِّ الصَّافِنَاتُ الْجِيَادُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "When the good horses were presented to him in the evening."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ إِنِّي أَحْبَبْتُ حُبَّ الْخَيْرِ ذِكْرَ رَبِّهِ حَتَّىٰ تَوَارَتْ بِالْحِجَابِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said, 'I prefer the good (horses) to the remembrance of my Lord, until they disappeared behind the curtain (of the setting sun).'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "رُدُّوهَا عَلَيَّ فَطَفِقَ مَسْحًا بِالسُّوقِ وَالْأَعْنَاقِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Bring them back to me, and he began to stroke their necks and legs."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَلَقَدْ فَتَنَّا سُلَيْمَانَ وَأَلْقَيْنَا عَلَىٰ كُرْسِيِّهِ جَسَدًا ثُمَّ أَنَابَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And We certainly tested Solomon and placed upon his throne a body (of a jinn or a man), then he turned back (to God)."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "قَالَ رَبِّ اغْفِرْ لِي وَهَبْ لِي مُلْكًا لَّا يَنبَغِي لِأَحَدٍ مِّن بَعْدِكَ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ الْوَهَّابُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said, 'My Lord, forgive me and grant me a kingdom such as none after me can have. Indeed, You are the Bestower.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَسَخَّرْنَا لَهُ الرِّيحَ تَجْرِي بِأَمْرِهِ رُخَاءً حَيْثُ أَقَرَّ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And We subjected to him the wind, blowing gently by his command, wherever he directed."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَالشَّيَاطِينَ كُلَّ بَنَّاءٍ وَغَوَّاصٍ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And the devils, every builder and diver."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَآخَرِينَ مُقَرَّنِينَ فِي الْأَصْفَادِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And others confined in chains."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "ذَٰلِكَ عَطَاؤُنَا فَامْنُنْ أَوْ أَمْسِكْ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "This is Our gift, so grant freely or withhold without account."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَلَهُ سُلَيْمَانَ الرِّيحَ عَاصِرَةً يَجْرِي أَمْرُهُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Solomon (We subjected) the wind, raging, proceeding by his command."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَالشَّيَاطِينَ كُلَّ بَنَّاءٍ وَغَوَّاصٍ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And the devils, every builder and diver."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَآخَرِينَ مُقَرَّنِينَ فِي الْأَصْفَادِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And others confined in chains."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "ذَٰلِكَ عَطَاؤُنَا فَامْنُنْ أَوْ أَمْسِكْ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "This is Our gift, so grant freely or withhold without account."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَوَهَبْنَا لَهُ إِسْحَاقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ ۚ كُلًّا هَدَيْنَا ۚ وَنُوحًا هَدَيْنَا مِن قَبْلُ ۖ وَمِن ذُرِّيَّتِهِ دَاوُودَ وَسُلَيْمَانَ وَأَيُّوبَ وَيُوسُفَ وَمُوسَىٰ وَهَارُونَ ۚ وَكَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِي الْمُحْسِنِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And We gave him Isaac and Jacob; each We guided. And Noah We guided before; and among his descendants David and Solomon and Job and Joseph and Moses and Aaron. Thus do We reward the doers of good."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَزَكَرِيَّا وَيَحْيَىٰ وَعِيسَىٰ وَإِلْيَاسَ ۖ وَكُلًّا مِّنَ الصَّالِحِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And Zechariah and John and Jesus and Elijah; and all of them were of the righteous."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِسْمَاعِيلَ وَالْيَسَعَ وَذُو الْكَفِّ ۖ وَكُلًّا مِّنَ الْأَبْرَارِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And Ishmael and Elisha and Jonah and Lot; and to each We gave wisdom and knowledge, and We favored them above the worlds."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "ذَٰلِكَ هُدًى ۗ يَهْدِي بِهِ مَن يَشَاءُ مِنْ عِبَادِنَا",
      "translations": {
        "en": "That is guidance. We give it to whom We will of Our servants."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِن كُنتُمْ لَفِي شَكٍّ مِّمَّا أَنزَلْنَا إِلَىٰ عَبْدِنَا فَأْتُوا بِسُورَةٍ مِّن مِّثْلِهِ وَادْعُوا شُهَدَاءَكُم مِّن دُونِ اللَّهِ إِن كُنتُمْ صَادِقِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And if you are in doubt about what We have sent down to Our servant, then produce a surah like it and call upon your witnesses other than Allah, if you should be truthful."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "فَإِن لَّمْ تَفْعَلُوا وَلَن تَفْعَلُوا فَاتَّقُوا النَّارَ الَّتِي وَقُودُهَا النَّاسُ وَالْحِجَارَةُ ۖ أُعِدَّتْ لِلْكَافِرِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "So if you do not do it - and you will never be able to - then fear the Fire, whose fuel is men and stones, prepared for the disbelievers."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَبَشِّرِ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَعَمِلُوا الصَّالِحَاتِ لَهُمْ جَنَّاتٌ تَجْرِي مِن تَحْتِهَا الْأَنْهَارُ ۖ كُلَّمَا رُزِقُوا مِنْهَا مِن ثَمَرَةٍ رِّزْقًا ۙ قَالُوا هَٰذَا الَّذِي رُزِقْنَا مِن قَبْلُ ۖ وَأُتُوا بِهِ مُتَشَابِهًا ۖ وَلَهُمْ فِيهَا أَزْوَاجٌ مُّطَهَّرَةٌ ۖ وَهُمْ فِيهَا خَالِدُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And give good tidings to those who believe and do righteous deeds that they will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. Every time they are provided with a provision of fruit therefrom, they will say, 'This is what we were provided with before.' And it is given to them in likeness. And they will have therein purified spouses, and they will abide therein eternally."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يَسْتَحْيِي أَن يَضْرِبَ مَثَلًا مَّا بَعُوضَةً فَمَا فَوْقَهَا ۚ فَأَمَّا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا فَيَعْلَمُونَ أَنَّهُ الْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّهِمْ ۖ وَأَمَّا الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا فَيَقُولُونَ مَاذَا أَرَادَ اللَّهُ بِهَٰذَا مَثَلًا ۘ يُضِلُّ بِهِ كَثِيرًا وَيَهْدِي بِهِ كَثِيرًا ۚ وَمَا يُضِلُّ بِهِ إِلَّا الْفَاسِقِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Indeed, Allah is not shy to present an example, that of a mosquito or what is smaller than it. And those who have believed know that it is the truth from their Lord. But as for those who disbelieve, they say, 'What did Allah intend by this as an example?' He misleads many thereby and guides many thereby. And He does not mislead except the defiantly disobedient."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "الَّذِينَ يَنقُضُونَ عَهْدَ اللَّهِ مِن بَعْدِ مِيثَاقِهِ وَيَقْطَعُونَ مَا أَمَرَ اللَّهُ بِهِ أَن يُوصَلَ وَيُفْسِدُونَ فِي الْأَرْضِ ۚ أُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ الْخَاسِرُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Who break the covenant of Allah after contracting it and sever that which Allah has ordered to be joined and cause corruption on earth. It is those who are the losers."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "كَيْفَ لَا تَكْفُرُونَ بِ اللَّهِ وَكُنتُمْ أَمْوَاتًا فَأَحْيَاكُمْ ۖ ثُمَّ يُمِيتُكُمْ ثُمَّ يُحْيِيكُمْ ثُمَّ إِلَيْهِ تُرْجَعُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "How can you disbelieve in Allah, while you were dead and He gave you life? Then He will cause you to die, then bring you back to life, and then to Him you will be returned."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ كُلُوا مِمَّا فِي الْأَرْضِ حَلَالًا طَيِّبًا وَلَا تَتَّبِعُوا خُطُوَاتِ الشَّيْطَانِ ۚ إِنَّهُ لَكُمْ عَدُوٌّ مُّبِينٌ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "O mankind, eat from whatever is on earth that is lawful and good, and do not follow the footsteps of Satan. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "إِنَّمَا يَأْمُرُكُم بِالسُّوءِ وَالْفَحْشَاءِ وَأَن تَقُولُوا عَلَى اللَّهِ مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He only commands you to evil and immorality and to say about Allah what you do not know."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ تَبُوا إِلَى اللَّهِ قَالَ إِنَّ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا آمَنُوا بِاللَّهِ وَإِن كُنتُمْ لَتَعْلَمُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And when it is said to them, 'Repent to Allah,' they say, 'Indeed, we believe in what was revealed to us.' And if you knew what they will face."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَيَقُولُونَ آمَنَّا بِاللَّهِ وَبِالرَّسُولِ وَأَطَعْنَا ثُمَّ يَتَوَلَّىٰ فَرِيقٌ مِّنْهُم مِّن بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ ۚ وَمَا أُولَٰئِكَ بِالْمُؤْمِنِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And they say, 'We have believed in Allah and in the Messenger and we obey.' Then a faction of them, after that, turns away. And it is those who are the true believers."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِذَا دُعُوا إِلَى اللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِ لِيَحْكُمَ بَيْنَهُمْ إِذَا فَرِيقٌ مِّنْهُم مُّعْرِضُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And when they are called to Allah and His Messenger to judge between them, behold, a faction of them turn away."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِن يَكُن لَّهُمُ الْحَقُّ يَأْتُوا إِلَيْهِ مُذْعِنِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And if the truth belongs to them, they come to him in submission."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فِي قُلُوبِهِم مَّرَضٌ فَزَادَهُمُ اللَّهُ مَرَضًا ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ بِمَا كَانُوا يَكْذِبُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "In their hearts is disease, so Allah has increased their disease; and for them is a painful punishment because they used to lie."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ لَا تُفْسِدُوا فِي الْأَرْضِ قَالُوا إِنَّمَا نَحْنُ مُصْلِحُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And when it is said to them, 'Do not cause corruption on earth,' they say, 'We are but reformers.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أَلَا إِنَّهُمْ هُمُ الْمُفْسِدُونَ وَلَٰكِن لَّا يَشْعُرُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Unquestionably, it is they who are the corrupters, but they perceive it not."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ آمِنُوا كَمَا آمَنَ النَّاسُ قَالُوا أَنُؤْمِنُ كَمَا آمَنَ السُّفَهَاءُ ۗ أَلَا إِنَّهُمْ هُمُ السُّفَهَاءُ وَلَٰكِن لَّا يَعْلَمُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And when it is said to them, 'Believe as the people have believed,' they say, 'Should we believe as the foolish have believed?' Unquestionably, it is they who are the foolish, but they know it not."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِذَا لَقُوا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا قَالُوا آمَنَّا وَإِذَا خَلَوْا إِلَىٰ شَيَاطِينِهِمْ قَالُوا إِنَّا مَعَكُمْ إِنَّمَا نَحْنُ مُسْتَهْزِئُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And when they meet those who believe, they say, 'We believe'; but when they are alone with their devils, they say, 'Indeed, we are with you; we were only mockers.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "اللَّهُ يَسْتَهْزِئُ بِهِمْ وَيَمُدُّهُمْ فِي طُغْيَانِهِمْ يَعْمَهُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Allah will mock them and leave them to wander blindly in their transgression."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أُولَٰئِكَ الَّذِينَ اشْتَرَوُا الضَّلَالَةَ بِالْهُدَىٰ فَمَا رَبِحَتْ تِّجَارَتُهُمْ وَمَا كَانُوا مُهْتَدِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Those are the ones who have purchased error in exchange for guidance, so their transaction has brought no profit, nor were they guided."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "مَّثَلُهُمْ كَمَثَلِ الَّذِي اسْتَوْقَدَ نَارًا فَلَمَّا أَضَاءَتْ مَا حَوْلَهُ ذَهَبَ اللَّهُ بِنُورِهِمْ وَتَرَكَهُمْ فِي ظُلُمَاتٍ لَّا يُبْصِرُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Their example is that of one who kindled a fire, but when it illuminated what was around him, Allah took away their light and left them in darkness so they could not see."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "صُمٌّ بُكْمٌ عُمْيٌ فَهُمْ لَا يَرْجِعُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Deaf, dumb and blind, so they will not return (to the path)."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "أَوْ كَصَيِّبٍ مِّنَ السَّمَاءِ فِيهِ ظُلُمَاتٌ وَرَعْدٌ وَبَرْقٌ يَجْعَلُونَ أَصَابِعَهُمْ فِي آذَانِهِم مِّنَ الصَّوَاعِقِ حَذَرَ الْمَوْتِ ۚ وَاللَّهُ مُحِيطٌ بِالْكَافِرِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Or like a rainstorm from the sky within which are darkness, thunder and lightning. They put their fingers in their ears from the thunderclaps out of fear of death. But Allah is encompassing of the disbelievers."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "كَادَ الْبَرْقُ يَخْطَفُ أَبْصَارَهُمْ ۖ كُلَّمَا أَضَاءَ لَهُم مَّشَوْا فِيهِ وَإِذَا أَظْلَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ قَامُوا ۚ وَلَوْ شَاءَ اللَّهُ لَأَذْهَبَ سَمْعَهُمْ وَأَبْصَارِهِمْ ۚ إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ",
      "translations": {
